Hi Sarah,

Welcome to your August CloudOffice Digest. This month, we’re highlighting some new features and sharing tips to help you get the most out of your workspace.

**What’s New in CloudOffice**
- **Smart Folders**: Organize your files automatically with AI-powered tagging. Learn more [here](https://www.cloudoffice.example/smart-folders).
- **Enhanced Collaboration Tools**: Real-time co-editing with version history is now available for all plans. Check out the [guide](https://help.cloudoffice.example/collaboration-tools).

**Tip of the Month**
Did you know you can customize your dashboard layout? Drag and drop widgets to create a workspace that fits your workflow. Read the [step-by-step instructions](https://support.cloudoffice.example/dashboard-customization).

**Upcoming Webinar**
Join us on August 28th for a live demo on maximizing productivity with CloudOffice. [Register now](https://events.cloudoffice.example/webinar-august-2024).

As always, your feedback helps us improve. Let us know what you think by replying to this email or visiting our [community forum](https://community.cloudoffice.example).

Thank you for being a part of CloudOffice.

Best regards,
